          "nudge_reason": null,
          "final_text_tail": "s the teardown stack close operation within a daemon thread with a timeout join.\n   - Copies the thread-local context stack to the teardown thread so `get_current_context()` remains functional within close callbacks.\n   - If the timeout is exceeded, logs a warning via `logging.getLogger(\"click\").warning(...)` to prevent indefinite blocking during context teardown.\n   - Preserves exception propagation if errors are raised within close callbacks when completing within the timeout.\n\n3. **Updated Shell Completion in [`src/click/shell_completion.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-6cnot20q/repo/src/click/shell_completion.py#L557-L585)**:\n   - Updated `_resolve_context` in [`src/click/shell_completion.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-6cnot20q/repo/src/click/shell_completion.py) to forward `cleanup_timeout=ctx.cleanup_timeout` when resolving nested contexts.\n\n4. **Testing**:\n   - Added unit tests in [`tests/test_context.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-6cnot20q/repo/tests/test_context.py) covering validation, inheritance, normal teardown, timeout handling, warning logging, and exception propagation.\n   - Added shell completion test in [`tests/test_shell_completion.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-6cnot20q/repo/tests/test_shell_completion.py).\n   - Ran test suites to verify all tests pass.\n",
